Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 22:22:48 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 37/38] perf(gdn): port #36267 Qwen3.5 GDN prefill projection
 layout optimization

Strided prefill z-view replaces contiguous copy on extend-without-speculative
path. Directly hits our qwen3_5 cold-prefill / long-chat continuation path;
DFlash verify (decode) unaffected by construction.
